.TH "OXCTL" 1 "" "Oxctl 0.1.0" "Oxctl Manual"
.\" Disable hyphenation and ragged-right
.nh
.ad l
.SH NAME
.P
oxctl \- command\-line interface for controlling oxbow
.SH SYNOPSIS
.P
\fBoxctl\fR [\fICOMMAND\fR] …
.SH COMMANDS
.TP 4
\fBbind\fR \fICOMMAND\fR …
Bind a key or pointer button to a command
.TP 4
\fBborder\fR \fICOMMAND\fR …
Border configuration commands
.TP 4
\fBconfig\fR \fICOMMAND\fR …
Configuration operations
.TP 4
\fBexec\fR [\fIOPTION\fR]… \fICOMMAND\fR…
Execute \fICOMMAND\fR as a shell command, e\N'46'g\N'46', \fI/bin/emacs \-\-eval "(scratch\-buffer\fR" )
.TP 4
\fBgaps\fR \fICOMMAND\fR …
Configure the gaps between windows
.TP 4
\fBinput\fR \fICOMMAND\fR …
Configure input devices
.TP 4
\fBkeymap\fR \fICOMMAND\fR …
Manage keymaps
.TP 4
\fBlayout\fR \fICOMMAND\fR …
Operations over layouts
.TP 4
\fBoutput\fR \fICOMMAND\fR …
Operate on outputs
.TP 4
\fBscratchpad\fR \fICOMMAND\fR …
Manage scratchpads
.TP 4
\fBseat\fR \fICOMMAND\fR …
Operate on seats
.TP 4
\fBsession\fR \fICOMMAND\fR …
Session control
.TP 4
\fBspawn\fR [\fIOPTION\fR]… \fISTRING\fR
Run \fISTRING\fR as a shell command, e\N'46'g\N'46', \fI/bin/sh \-c STRING\fR
.TP 4
\fBsubscribe\fR [\fB\-\-human\fR] [\fB\-\-output\fR=\fINAME\fR] [\fIOPTION\fR]… [\fIKIND\fR]…
Stream state\-change events as JSON lines
.TP 4
\fBtag\fR \fICOMMAND\fR …
Operate on tag views
.TP 4
\fBunbind\fR [\fB\-\-mode\fR=\fIMODE\fR] [\fIOPTION\fR]… \fIKEYBIND\fR
Unbind the given KEYBIND
.TP 4
\fBwindow\fR \fICOMMAND\fR …
Operations over windows
.TP 4
\fBwm\fR \fICOMMAND\fR …
Window\-manager control
