.SH "TAG NEXT"
.P
View the next tag, wraps back to the first tag when called from the last tag
.SS SYNOPSIS
.P
\fBoxctl tag next\fR [\fB\-\-occupied\fR] [\fIOPTION\fR]…
.SS OPTIONS
.TP 4
\fB\-\-occupied\fR
Restrict operation to occupied tags\N'46'
.SH "TAG PREV"
.P
View the previous tag, wraps back to the last tag when viewing the first tag
.SS SYNOPSIS
.P
\fBoxctl tag prev\fR [\fB\-\-occupied\fR] [\fIOPTION\fR]…
.SS OPTIONS
.TP 4
\fB\-\-occupied\fR
Restrict operation to occupied tags\N'46'
.SH "TAG PREVIOUS-SELECTION"
.P
